<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $1.00-5.00 higher; butts 2.00-3.00 higher; skinned hams 17-20#'s weak to 2.00 lower, 20-26#'s weak to 1.00 lower; seedless bellies weak to 2.00 lower; lean trimmings steady to weak.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light to moderate demand and offerings.</p>
<p>-USDA</p>
